    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d371207e6e33de318d4ab1a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・第一次！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a26d5058fc8bb882908526b97c719030a8e7394eec8274894c1d07c9bc4afee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b051cf40208b603448cf3264",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然春丽没有得胜，\n但她一脸满足，看起来很享受比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dff2497f259f66cd8134968562253e2e95e96c0fc6a8d7863010c5e84340feb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1da8d89c71a67d4715d468b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春丽与训练员握拳举向天空，\n表达了今后也要不断参加比赛、\n累积经验的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "451e7694403bef4a315ad752cd0f856d37f1f160ece22697bba9d8d611433278",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eec0aa7d307ad7560f0b9a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "准备回去时，\n到场声援的商店街居民们，\n也给予春丽盛大的祝贺。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9f6c8787800b89af4e174a570198d5b9dcb03c6bd827242ccfa8546867faee5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b9dc9ff018952fe4770445",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对商店街的人们对自己的期待，\n为了回报他们对自己疼爱有加的心意，\n春丽发誓要变得更强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52c45ed13d6a6c97592d3bcc5f73609f0e02fdbd8661842fad346c0bfa04a38e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66ed8e2793945647c73ac221",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・书法高超的烤鸡店",
      "source_fingerprint": "c99cbafb7d5b102d88f040eb0ebdf04720535525375520e3e10b117e83a8e1c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3f3369a0823ee7acbc59bdb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6494142fdbcc8d1e9c0c0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某一天，春丽收到一项消息，\n据说商店街的居民们将成立“后援会”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2220f0dbe203685be1332e326a478fb29223d5a5a020c48b6658ab4ed64a0b71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fea73555d6cb8c014a894d59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b116ac5815fcc7498292eb6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春丽原本不太了解“后援会”的意思，\n但听到会有很多人尽力支持自己时，\n依然让她十分开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a67c40e96299cc6a701db2d0cedfc1f632519e13910f213b106051689459e86e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8b2312052c92340a38f9d58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8fc515c8d353ccc7cf5577d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "愿意支持她的粉丝人数越多，\n就越能成为春丽的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3312efba3593b54948bbb97ee140e95cd333937e97a52a798483a1cab4d69ad5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a13840fa1f31007eb219213",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fbbd8f7acfdeb231003843d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "体会到这件事的训练员下定决心，\n要一边继续参赛，\n一边设法增加她的粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9e9886a57d0e289ca3a3c98daef36a209546e8f8f8008c8156af259cd59c26f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9482508380d65595bf0ee860",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大家的人气王达成后・后援会！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "de2bf9cda2efb766a7c10784c3f5bf7a6fa0dd13c3f52aaf645b4154e06726c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efa256c327323afaf8516476",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春丽依然难以获胜。\n但“不管跑输几次都很努力的赛马娘”这点，\n却已经开始在世人间蔚为话题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "055af4e9fc75e6686554ef50ac244a0885b5c311a40a7ecf5f61be483a017684",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01b008a965d120657d1273cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那样的氛围下，\n春丽透过与加入“后援会”的粉丝交流，\n而让她的动力变得更强烈了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ff20cd358c324d0551d48e9ecc21d5e3871163574c6cf7aa23677a27ebaff13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed41502472926c92fd25cabb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到干劲熊熊燃烧的她，\n训练员更加坚定地想陪她找到目标竞赛，\n帮助她获得第一名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6a5b7a4cb9c65bdf9292ae4eac3b25f92fcbdc96372461cd7704f14f010fc0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fb9ea438690c87d02bde7a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大家的人气王达成后・超强意志力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d15364293d435add7500113dcaa00fe7c5b254718a3bed550fcd4fad40d1fd6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fa78555a01a7a064eeb8f81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”……这场倍受瞩目的赛事，\n仅有博得高支持度的顶尖赛马娘才能参赛。\n春丽也来到了比赛现场观战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6188b1add30fa240398476b339808ee0553e22d0e40ae4197ad0addd6f455156",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be2514f48c5bec367ad17d17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到特别周与草上飞那\n有如使尽全力般的认真对决，\n让春丽感到情绪高昂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff529376fdba9063a12ad7db2a3d5697d0cd6a596905bb5c3ff8c39189cc1c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56039231977437a6e754f587",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她大声说出自己也想跑令人心跳加速的比赛，\n所以决定参加“有马纪念”的愿望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ee68f1b55e922016a1eb2ddfa64a917ceee5a00aa41e334c966997da3b0d373",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b11632c5d98ee678d28fd07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春丽的发言被认为是“有勇无谋”，\n而引起四周一阵哗然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9743531e06419eb5b5f3be61144ae631ed9f2456af0ea60422d61b34eaa58106",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a4799c17c5aad9def32a923",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但春丽毫不在意旁人的反应。\n于是……为了参加“有马纪念”，\n春丽展开了艰辛严苛的战役！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b5b6f451c9ca110a90807811ed059f06cb31661ca7bc28663fb5d1adcf29527",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16eeebfe37fdf4dccf425d08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大家的人气王达成后・目标是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "73bd993e9408b1488f5412d9f6e9bdbb1be05672a9da5b61e2d07343c0286f31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a3bd1baaf0945fca33dee8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "称霸激烈的赛事，在“有马纪念”赢得\n第一名荣耀的，竟然是春丽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cabedd9091d886b7e0a5cca5c90ad35b8466a3291fbe78af9a0308fb61c0be9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a49b86e4518ec44490334e9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但春丽却感到懊悔，\n她觉得好像不是自己在跑，一点都不快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "274e1d3a4339c26bba3162718e5095f134dce75a920521f7dfe484b2b8ac0fdf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0294a947452f9cce25a64800",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想更加快乐地在“有马纪念”上奔跑。\n春丽强烈地这么想着，\n并宣布要再次参加“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aad7717939258766faeced369573927056cb5c796f431d5308aafa92f417dbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
