    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6350817d0c741c9538444ea4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听到四周涌起祝贺春丽的欢呼声，\n她真切地感受到自己已经具备\n参加“有马纪念”的资格。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a77b83712d90e1821b34e6627961f404ad8dd46f1892a8097d838851ed07a802",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
