      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:321c3ab0f8e03c43fcdcd3aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在回程路上，到场观看春丽比赛的\n特别周跟青云天空也前来鼓励她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "455e4e504d55e4dea520e246c068750c96ba32bf6a358c08b8fdd25ae4b88aae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6958969a39c696415c920bf4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春丽得知两人也将参加\n“有马纪念”，便发表宣言，\n说自己不会输给竞争对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f0c150fbaa62ebb6af20539dadc7d37dcfaa2580489e0d022d5f47753ec315d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afe92e6496cedf086e2c9898",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "JBC短途赛结束后・竞争对手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12186dfff71f787e6fc4c3c8f8d8cf4fa36547a996b33b779222cec92baef2cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af6fb554b233dc28a9946faa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春丽气喘吁吁地跑了回来。\n她以优异突出的表现\n在“有马纪念”夺冠了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8b84d8bad374095c08b4e8725907c6d4ecb71b2e0facb2c15c94af013841116",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6304a29edc471b17ab6984f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "商店街的人们与众多竞争对手们\n都全心全意为她献上祝福，\n春丽细细品尝着这份喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e57b6ac8bbeb9ded1fdb2b9001dbb81b9d8f8a3b0e21723abb6d4d0c44f3a76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052429.json",
      "json_path": [
