    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6af4a8e7f2d832257118ac6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然春丽发自内心地享受了\n比赛的乐趣……但落败的懊悔\n还是令她流下了眼泪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbf1f41914be0514a056d8e86f1f9813cca489112c927b2d914f0bc0dec8ff91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052430.json",
      "json_path": [
