      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，这场春丽在梦想舞台上\n全力冲刺到最后的“有马纪念”，\n便就此落幕了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2063cd9d6086efaace2fd173824f24d4b9cb1c218585111f7d31ffef24dd27c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
